  "plantuml": "@startuml\nskinparam componentStyle uml2\n\ntitle Architecture: FleetMonitor-IoT (Service-Based Architecture)\n\npackage \"Infrastructure\" {\n  [APIGateway] as COMP-001 <<gateway>>\n  [EventStore] as COMP-009 <<datastore>>\n  [MessageQueue] as COMP-010 <<queue>>\n  [SharedDatabase] as COMP-011 <<datastore>>\n  [EdgeAgent] as COMP-012 <<service>>\n  [Cache] as COMP-013 <<cache>>\n  [CloudServiceProvider] as COMP-014 <<external>>\n}\n\npackage \"Presentation\" {\n  [FleetManagerBFF] as COMP-002 <<service>>\n  [DriverBFF] as COMP-003 <<service>>\n}\n\npackage \"Application\" {\n  [VehicleTelemetryService] as COMP-004 <<service>>\n  [AlertService] as COMP-005 <<service>>\n  [DispatchService] as COMP-006 <<service>>\n  [TripLogService] as COMP-007 <<service>>\n  [DeviceManagementService] as COMP-008 <<service>>\n}\n\n\nCOMP-001 --> COMP-002 : HTTPS/REST\nCOMP-001 --> COMP-003 : HTTPS/REST\nCOMP-001 --> COMP-008 : HTTPS/REST\nCOMP-002 --> COMP-013 : In-process memory call\nCOMP-003 --> COMP-013 : In-process memory call\nCOMP-002 --> COMP-006 : HTTPS/REST\nCOMP-002 --> COMP-011 : PostgreSQL wire protocol\nCOMP-003 --> COMP-011 : PostgreSQL wire protocol\nCOMP-012 --> COMP-004 : gRPC over HTTP/2 with mTLS\nCOMP-001 --> COMP-005 : HTTPS/REST\nCOMP-001 --> COMP-007 : HTTPS/REST\nCOMP-002 --> COMP-009 : PostgreSQL wire protocol\nCOMP-002 ..> COMP-010 : AMQP / Kafka protocol\nCOMP-014 --> COMP-001 : HTTPS/REST\n\n@enduml"
